OL,3,GNEWSAInmate's baby died due to
OL,4,Apregnancy complications
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe one-day-old baby of a Derbyshire
OL,7,Fprisoner died due to pregnancy
OL,8,Fcomplications and gaps in contact with
OL,9,Fmaternity services while his mother was
OL,10,Fliving in the community, an inquest
OL,11,Fjury has ruled.
OL,13,FOrion Homer was born at 01:06 on 15
OL,14,FOctober 2023 at Royal Derby Hospital at
OL,15,F34 weeks plus five days' gestation. He
OL,16,Fdied the following day.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
