OL,3,GNEWSAInmate's baby died due to
OL,4,Apregnancy complications
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest at Derby Coroner's Court
OL,7,Fheard his mother, Ellen Roberts, was a
OL,8,Fprisoner at HMP Foston Hall and was
OL,9,Ftaken to the hospital on 14 October
OL,10,Fafter she raised concerns about reduced
OL,11,Ffoetal movement.
OL,13,FSenior coroner Peter Nieto read out the
OL,14,Fjury's narrative conclusion and said he
OL,15,Fwould escalate their findings to NHS
OL,16,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
